:"整体布局与轮廓：大灯区域采用“四横两纵”的布局设计，两侧大灯呈现类似C字型的结构，并配有纵向的灯组结构，整体造型偏向方形，极具庄严感。材质与工艺：首创车规级水晶大灯设计，日行内透镜采用水晶材质，内部拥有96个不规则的钻石切割面。经过近百道工序手工打磨，配合多层光学镀膜及激光镭雕工艺，呈现出极强的通透感与璀璨光泽。星河灯效：大灯内部融入了密集的点阵光源，通过多层光学设计模拟出星轨效果。点亮后能够展现出“星汉灿烂”的动态光效，形成极具纵深感的宇宙星河视觉。以上是官方说明，而官方将其命名为\"纵横星瀚大灯\"。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWHNay7kbyEogaTmgufdh3ibO4jOEjxWia5RCibibGhQkiajvccLKrIA4RkPW7icYmpqMhvpBKIicOgrPg0fNEsnsb8MooG5WQib5sZseiaE/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg&watermark=1"},{"t":"text","v":"从后灯壳看，可见DLP外置风扇，两个外置驱动。壳体信息如下："},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/KTj61r3bYWH4HQmVeDceibn6wF0aJS8Pia8OKccoJHf8ODmHRy7sIriawJtQrtg8FUF1KcrYfrOnZnFfiaMVBThbwkyK9pvN62f4uMugoIicv2iaU/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg&watermark=1"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/KTj61r3bYWFJ0w1d41xWpnHvibic9MrNUb7BqjhVrEdkSOXSLNUr34Mia48o8eFWZ03icjb3v0oqr4zH5vk3OzbTotcScxl5U64OI9EUtUP9Rrw/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg&watermark=1"},{"t":"text","v":"椭球主光源分别是远近光椭球，ADB椭球和DLP椭球(这车身摆放位置有点低了？算了，还是造型优先吧……)"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWEXKrFAXvQxBvicvqPVM2Lutic8cnXGFpjPVzeib7OKqFDiaIskEF2L4mTnx1uNickRguya09gEnyaOMvBMibw1nQkHCCZmTYn4r89cM/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg&watermark=1"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWHw9XCzicB3j6zhbYBoGRenHsUk8Y3At11VLOMAda2SmTV8kX8kTB9QHB7mGGNUGTS9dcfGH5kkgTv0gMBJsN6AV5eNyF0s78LI/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg&watermark=1"},{"t":"text","v":"拆开外透镜及主饰圈，可见其璀璨的内透镜，"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWEf1zyic5Woqn8aUfdCLtZrwtcWiaJNHHicdia5oE4csnfPFzP2O3mYuZ6NwV6822aObqiafNsxUrksoJW3pzf9OPN2qe2MPXTU2JPM/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&watermark=1"},{"t":"text","v":"主饰圈的星光孔，"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWGzdRbeMsSbibLyeVZYZvarx8sdh8ibcbyZkBzy3Jm5WYe1POREXkwBqiciczvWagtCibyINiadmeSSYrUcwhQUKzr5icSUyXtugaw4ro/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg&watermark=1"},{"t":"text","v":"内透镜分为上下左右四块，根据造型设计成高矮胖瘦的形状，内透镜后面是相应的灯板，"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWH468kdAceFXc